{"name":"Bildoobaris","status":"ok","title":"Bildoobaris","pageId":22483,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bildoobaris</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Seasonal tent city</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Lands\" title=\"Cold Lands\">Cold Lands</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nar</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">humans</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"languages\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Languages</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Naric\" title=\"Naric\">Naric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damaran_language\" title=\"Damaran language\">Damaran</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-RoF-p107_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoF-p107-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30,000 (summer)<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Bildoobaris</b>, also simply called the <b>Trade Fair</b>, was a large tent city and the unofficial capital of <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a> as of <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a> that dominated the plains of Narfell for one tenday each summer.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p30-31_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p30-31-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bildoobaris?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Though certainly not a permanent location, the Trade Fair was home to upwards of 30,000 <a href=\"/wiki/Nar\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Nar\">Nar</a> every summer as members of the various tribes meet on the vast plains. The plains were covered for miles in every direction with thousands of hide tents while the Nar welcomed merchants from the west to trade goods. This was the only time of the year when foreigners were welcomed in Narfell. The festival was the largest and most important holiday in all of Narfell, with even the cruelest and most fierce Nar tribes joining the drinking, feasting, and trading that happened over the tenday.<sup id=\"cite_ref-BL-p30-31_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BL-p30-31-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bildoobaris?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bildoobaris?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Icy_Queen%27s_Crossing\" title=\"The Icy Queen's Crossing\">The Icy Queen's Crossing</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bildoobaris?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editse